--- ADJACENT FINDING (flagged, not fixed -- out of this dispatch's scope) ---
70 anonymous requests against a 60/min configured cap produced ZERO 429s
and zero auth_rate_limited log lines, on a single confirmed instance/IP.
This means the in-process limiter itself did not trip when it should
have on the CURRENT code, independent of the Upstash question. Not
diagnosed further here (would require reading req.ip resolution under
HAUSKA_TRUST_PROXY=1 against Cloud Run's actual proxy hop count, or
instrumenting the identifier used per request) -- flagged to
_scratch/76j-workstream-c.md as an OPEN item for the next agent /
operator decision, since fixing it is a distinct bug from the Upstash
store-replacement this dispatch scopes.

